{"code":"hi","name":"Hindi","native":"हिन्दी","phase":2,"medium":"en","file_level":"A1","pronunciation":[{"t":"अ is a short clear A, like 'but'","r":"a","tip":"कमल (kamal) = lotus. Never say 'ey' — short and clean!"},{"t":"ट ठ ड ढ ण curl the tongue BACK","r":"ṭa ṭha ḍa ḍha ṇa","tip":"Touch the roof of the mouth, not the teeth: टमाटर (ṭamāṭar) = tomato."},{"t":"त थ द ध न touch the TEETH","r":"ta tha da dha na","tip":"ताला (tālā) = lock. Teeth-sounds vs roof-sounds — Hindi has BOTH sets!"},{"t":"Aspirates add a puff: ख घ छ झ","r":"kha gha chha jha","tip":"खाना (khānā) = food — feel the air burst! Hold paper before your mouth!"},{"t":"ं adds a nasal hum","r":"~n","tip":"मैं (main) = I, हूँ (hūn) = am. Hum through the nose!"}],"alphabet":{"title":"Devanagari: vowels + consonants","explain":"Hindi uses Devanagari, written left-to-right with a headline bar (शिरोरेखा)! Learn vowels first, then consonants in family rows (क-row, च-row, ट-row, त-row, प-row). Vowel signs (मात्रा) attach to consonants: क + ा = का!","letters":[{"t":"अ","r":"a (short)"},{"t":"आ","r":"ā (long a)"},{"t":"इ","r":"i (short)"},{"t":"ई","r":"ī (long ee)"},{"t":"उ","r":"u (short)"},{"t":"ऊ","r":"ū (long oo)"},{"t":"ऋ","r":"ri"},{"t":"ए","r":"e (eh)"},{"t":"ऐ","r":"ai"},{"t":"ओ","r":"o (oh)"},{"t":"औ","r":"au"},{"t":"क","r":"ka"},{"t":"ख","r":"kha (aspirated)"},{"t":"ग","r":"ga"},{"t":"घ","r":"gha (aspirated)"},{"t":"च","r":"cha"},{"t":"छ","r":"chha (aspirated)"},{"t":"ज","r":"ja"},{"t":"झ","r":"jha (aspirated)"},{"t":"ट","r":"ṭa (retroflex)"},{"t":"ठ","r":"ṭha (retroflex asp.)"},{"t":"ड","r":"ḍa (retroflex)"},{"t":"ढ","r":"ḍha (retroflex asp.)"},{"t":"त","r":"ta (dental)"},{"t":"थ","r":"tha (dental asp.)"},{"t":"द","r":"da (dental)"},{"t":"ध","r":"dha (dental asp.)"},{"t":"न","r":"na"},{"t":"प","r":"pa"},{"t":"फ","r":"pha (aspirated)"},{"t":"ब","r":"ba"},{"t":"भ","r":"bha (aspirated)"},{"t":"म","r":"ma"},{"t":"य","r":"ya"},{"t":"र","r":"ra (flapped)"},{"t":"ल","r":"la"},{"t":"व","r":"va/wa"},{"t":"श","r":"sha"},{"t":"ष","r":"ṣa (retroflex sh)"},{"t":"स","r":"sa"},{"t":"ह","r":"ha"}]},"counting":{"title":"Counting 0 to 100","explain":"Hindi numbers 1–20 are unique words — memorise them! Tens (बीस, तीस…) then combine: इक्कीस = 21 (20+1 fused). 100 = सौ!","numbers":[{"t":"शून्य","r":"shūnya","en":"0"},{"t":"एक","r":"ek","en":"1"},{"t":"दो","r":"do","en":"2"},{"t":"तीन","r":"tīn","en":"3"},{"t":"चार","r":"chār","en":"4"},{"t":"पाँच","r":"pāṅch","en":"5"},{"t":"छह","r":"chhah","en":"6"},{"t":"सात","r":"sāt","en":"7"},{"t":"आठ","r":"āṭh","en":"8"},{"t":"नौ","r":"nau","en":"9"},{"t":"दस","r":"das","en":"10"},{"t":"ग्यारह","r":"gyārah","en":"11"},{"t":"बारह","r":"bārah","en":"12"},{"t":"तेरह","r":"terah","en":"13"},{"t":"चौदह","r":"chaudah","en":"14"},{"t":"पंद्रह","r":"pandrah","en":"15"},{"t":"सोलह","r":"solah","en":"16"},{"t":"सत्रह","r":"satrah","en":"17"},{"t":"अठारह","r":"aṭhārah","en":"18"},{"t":"उन्नीस","r":"unnīs","en":"19"},{"t":"बीस","r":"bīs","en":"20"},{"t":"तीस","r":"tīs","en":"30"},{"t":"चालीस","r":"chālīs","en":"40"},{"t":"पचास","r":"pachās","en":"50"},{"t":"साठ","r":"sāṭh","en":"60"},{"t":"सत्तर","r":"sattar","en":"70"},{"t":"अस्सी","r":"assī","en":"80"},{"t":"नब्बे","r":"nabbe","en":"90"},{"t":"सौ","r":"sau","en":"100"}],"rules":["1–20 are unique: एक, दो, तीन… बीस — memorise all twenty.","21+ fuses tens + ones: इक्कीस (21), बाईस (22). 100 = सौ, 1000 = हज़ार."]},"level":{"title":"Starter: greetings, है, first verbs","goals":["Greet people and introduce yourself","Use है, यह/वह and plurals","Use present verbs and say 'I have'"],"units":[{"id":"A1-U1","title":"First words","lessons":[{"id":"A1-U1-L1","title":"Greetings: नमस्ते","learn":"नमस्ते (hello — I bow to you!), नमस्कार (formal hello). Meeting: मैं + name + हूँ → आपसे मिलकर खुशी हुई (happy to meet you)! Fold hands, bow slightly!","vocab":[{"t":"नमस्ते","r":"namaste","en":"hello","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"नमस्कार","r":"namaskār","en":"hello (formal)","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"सुप्रभात","r":"suprabhāt","en":"good morning","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"शुभ संध्या","r":"shubh sandhyā","en":"good evening","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"धन्यवाद","r":"dhanyavād","en":"thank you","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"माफ़ कीजिए","r":"māf kījie","en":"sorry / excuse me","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"हाँ","r":"hāṅ","en":"yes","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"नहीं","r":"nahīṅ","en":"no / not","pos":"phrase"}],"grammar":{"title":"मैंXहूँ + आपसे मिलकर खुशी हुई","explain":"मैं प्रिया हूँ = I am Priya. हूँ = am (only for मैं!). आपसे मिलकर खुशी हुई = meeting-you brought joy!","pattern":"मैं + name + हूँ","examples":[{"t":"नमस्ते, मैं प्रिया हूँ।","r":"namaste, main Priyā hūṅ.","en":"Hello, I am Priya."},{"t":"आपसे मिलकर खुशी हुई!","r":"āpse milkar khushī huī!","en":"Nice to meet you!"},{"t":"धन्यवाद!","r":"dhanyavād!","en":"Thanks!"}],"mistakes":["Saying मैं हूँ हूँ — one हूँ only!","Saying तुम to elders — use आप!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"प्रिया","t":"नमस्ते, मैं प्रिया हूँ।","r":"namaste, main Priyā hūṅ.","en":"Hello, I am Priya."},{"sp":"राहुल","t":"नमस्ते, मैं राहुल हूँ।","r":"namaste, main Rāhul hūṅ.","en":"Hello, I am Rahul."},{"sp":"प्रिया","t":"आपसे मिलकर खुशी हुई!","r":"āpse milkar khushī huī!","en":"Nice to meet you!"},{"sp":"राहुल","t":"मुझे भी!","r":"mujhe bhī!","en":"Me too!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I am Priya","answer":"मैं प्रिया हूँ"},{"type":"fill","q":"___! (Nice to meet you)","answer":"आपसे मिलकर खुशी हुई"},{"type":"choose","q":"To elders you say…","options":["तुम","आप","तू","ये"],"answer":"आप"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: हूँ / प्रिया / मैं","answer":"मैं प्रिया हूँ"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: मैं प्रिया हूँ।","answer":"मैं प्रिया हूँ।"}],"quiz":[{"q":"नमस्ते means…","options":["goodbye","hello (I bow to you)","thanks","sorry"],"answer":1,"why":"नमस्ते = hello with folded hands."},{"q":"आपसे मिलकर खुशी हुई means…","options":["thank you","nice to meet you","excuse me","good luck"],"answer":1,"why":"Meeting-joy phrase."},{"q":"माफ़ कीजिए means…","options":["thanks","sorry / excuse me","hello","yes"],"answer":1,"why":"माफ़ कीजिए = formal sorry."},{"q":"मुझे भी means…","options":["goodbye","me too","never","maybe"],"answer":1,"why":"मुझे + भी = me-too."},{"q":"हूँ is used with…","options":["आप","मैं","वह","ये"],"answer":1,"why":"मैं + हूँ only!"}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Greetings worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Hindi.","items":["hello","thank you","yes"],"key":["नमस्ते","धन्यवाद","हाँ"]},{"instruction":"Introduce yourself.","items":["Hello, I am Priya","Nice to meet you"],"key":["नमस्ते, मैं प्रिया हूँ","आपसे मिलकर खुशी हुई"]},{"instruction":"Dayparts.","items":["good morning","good evening"],"key":["सुप्रभात","शुभ संध्या"]}]}},{"id":"A1-U1-L2","title":"Names and आप कैसे हैं","learn":"Ask names: आपका नाम क्या है? (what is your name?) → मेरा नाम… How are you: आप कैसे हैं? → मैं ठीक हूँ! हैं/हूँ/हो/है — four BE-forms. क्या asks, ठीक answers!","vocab":[{"t":"मैं","r":"main","en":"I","pos":"pronoun"},{"t":"आप","r":"āp","en":"you (formal)","pos":"pronoun"},{"t":"नाम","r":"nām","en":"name","pos":"noun"},{"t":"आपका नाम क्या है","r":"āpkā nām kyā hai","en":"what is your name","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"मेरा नाम","r":"merā nām","en":"my name","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"आप कैसे हैं","r":"āp kaise hain","en":"how are you","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"मैं ठीक हूँ","r":"main ṭhīk hūṅ","en":"I'm fine","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"कृपया","r":"kripayā","en":"please","pos":"phrase"}],"grammar":{"title":"हूँ/हो/है/हैं","explain":"मैं हूँ (I am), तुम हो (you-casual are), वह है (he/she is), आप हैं (you-formal are). BE-form changes with WHO!","pattern":"मैं हूँ · तुम हो · वह है · आप हैं","examples":[{"t":"आप कैसे हैं?","r":"āp kaise hain?","en":"How are you? (formal)"},{"t":"मैं ठीक हूँ!","r":"main ṭhīk hūṅ!","en":"I'm fine!"},{"t":"आपका नाम क्या है?","r":"āpkā nām kyā hai?","en":"What is your name?"}],"mistakes":["Saying मैं हैं — मैं takes हूँ!","Saying आप है — आप takes हैं!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"राहुल","t":"आपका नाम क्या है?","r":"āpkā nām kyā hai?","en":"What is your name?"},{"sp":"प्रिया","t":"मेरा नाम प्रिया है। आप कैसे हैं?","r":"merā nām Priyā hai. āp kaise hain?","en":"My name is Priya. How are you?"},{"sp":"राहुल","t":"मैं ठीक हूँ! और आप?","r":"main ṭhīk hūṅ! aur āp?","en":"I'm fine! And you?"},{"sp":"प्रिया","t":"मैं भी ठीक हूँ!","r":"main bhī ṭhīk hūṅ!","en":"I'm fine too!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: How are you? (formal)","answer":"आप कैसे हैं"},{"type":"fill","q":"मैं ___ हूँ! (fine)","answer":"ठीक"},{"type":"choose","q":"मैं takes…","options":["हैं","हूँ","हो","है"],"answer":"हूँ"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: हैं / कैसे / आप","answer":"आप कैसे हैं"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: आप कैसे हैं?","answer":"आप कैसे हैं?"}],"quiz":[{"q":"आपका नाम क्या है? asks…","options":["my name","your name","his name","no name"],"answer":1,"why":"आपका नाम = your name."},{"q":"मैं ठीक हूँ means…","options":["not well","I'm fine","so-so","busy"],"answer":1,"why":"ठीक = fine/okay."},{"q":"और आप? means…","options":["who are you","and you?","where are you","why you"],"answer":1,"why":"और = and."},{"q":"वह takes…","options":["हूँ","हो","है","हैं"],"answer":2,"why":"वह + है."},{"q":"कृपया means…","options":["thanks","please","sorry","hello"],"answer":1,"why":"कृपया = please."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"BE-forms worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Hindi.","items":["I","you (formal)","name"],"key":["मैं","आप","नाम"]},{"instruction":"Match हूँ/हो/है/हैं.","items":["How are you? (formal)","I'm fine!","What is your name?"],"key":["आप कैसे हैं","मैं ठीक हूँ","आपका नाम क्या है"]},{"instruction":"Answer.","items":["And you?","I'm fine too!"],"key":["और आप","मैं भी ठीक हूँ"]}]}}]},{"id":"A1-U2","title":"है and plurals","lessons":[{"id":"A1-U2-L1","title":"है and यह/वह","learn":"Point! यह (this), वह (that). यह किताब है = This is a book. Not: नहीं — verb LAST: यह किताब नहीं है! Adjectives agree: बड़ा लड़का (big boy), बड़ी लड़की (big girl)!","vocab":[{"t":"यह","r":"yah","en":"this","pos":"pronoun"},{"t":"वह","r":"vah","en":"that / he / she","pos":"pronoun"},{"t":"किताब","r":"kitāb","en":"book (f)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"स्कूल","r":"skūl","en":"school (m)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"गाड़ी","r":"gāṛī","en":"car (f)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"बड़ा","r":"baṛā","en":"big (m)","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"छोटा","r":"chhoṭā","en":"small (m)","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"घर","r":"ghar","en":"house (m)","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"यहXहै · नहीं LAST · बड़ा/बड़ी","explain":"यह किताब है (this is a book), वह घर है (that is a house). Negative: यह किताब नहीं है — नहीं before है! Adjectives: बड़ा (m), बड़ी (f)!","pattern":"यह/वह + X + है · नहीं before है","examples":[{"t":"यह किताब है।","r":"yah kitāb hai.","en":"This is a book."},{"t":"वह बड़ा घर है।","r":"vah baṛā ghar hai.","en":"That is a big house."},{"t":"यह किताब नहीं है।","r":"yah kitāb nahīṅ hai.","en":"This is not a book."}],"mistakes":["Saying नहीं है किताब — order: X + नहीं + है!","Saying बड़ी लड़का — boys take बड़ा!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"प्रिया","t":"यह किताब है?","r":"yah kitāb hai?","en":"Is this a book?"},{"sp":"राहुल","t":"हाँ, यह बड़ी किताब है।","r":"hāṅ, yah baṛī kitāb hai.","en":"Yes, this is a big book."},{"sp":"प्रिया","t":"वह स्कूल है?","r":"vah skūl hai?","en":"Is that a school?"},{"sp":"राहुल","t":"हाँ!","r":"hāṅ!","en":"Yes!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: This is a book","answer":"यह किताब है"},{"type":"fill","q":"___ स्कूल है। (That)","answer":"वह"},{"type":"choose","q":"'This is not a book' is…","options":["यह किताब है","यह किताब नहीं है","यह नहीं किताब है","यह है नहीं किताब"],"answer":"यह किताब नहीं है"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: है / किताब / यह","answer":"यह किताब है"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: यह किताब है।","answer":"यह किताब है।"}],"quiz":[{"q":"वह means…","options":["this","that / he / she","here","what"],"answer":1,"why":"वह = that + he/she."},{"q":"नहीं goes…","options":["first","before है","after है","nowhere"],"answer":1,"why":"X + नहीं + है."},{"q":"बड़ी किताब matches because…","options":["both big","both feminine","both plural","both new"],"answer":1,"why":"किताब (f) + बड़ी (f)."},{"q":"गाड़ी is…","options":["masculine","feminine","plural","verb"],"answer":1,"why":"गाड़ी = feminine."},{"q":"घर is…","options":["masculine","feminine","plural","verb"],"answer":0,"why":"घर = masculine."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Pointing worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Hindi.","items":["this","that","book"],"key":["यह","वह","किताब"]},{"instruction":"Point and name.","items":["This is a book","That is a school","This is not a book"],"key":["यह किताब है","वह स्कूल है","यह किताब नहीं है"]},{"instruction":"Agree gender.","items":["a big book (f)","a big house (m)"],"key":["बड़ी किताब","बड़ा घर"]}]}},{"id":"A1-U2-L2","title":"Plurals: किताबें","learn":"Plurals shift! किताब → किताबें (books), लड़का → लड़के (boys), लड़की → लड़कियाँ (girls). Feminine -ी → -ियाँ! कितने? (how many-m), कितनी? (how many-f)!","vocab":[{"t":"एक","r":"ek","en":"one","pos":"number"},{"t":"दो","r":"do","en":"two","pos":"number"},{"t":"तीन","r":"tīn","en":"three","pos":"number"},{"t":"किताबें","r":"kitāben","en":"books","pos":"noun"},{"t":"लोग","r":"log","en":"people","pos":"noun"},{"t":"बहुत","r":"bahut","en":"many / very","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"थोड़ा","r":"thoṛā","en":"a little","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"कितने","r":"kitne","en":"how many (m)","pos":"phrase"}],"grammar":{"title":"-एँ/-ए/-ियाँ plurals","explain":"किताब→किताबें, लड़का→लड़के, लड़की→लड़कियाँ, घर→घर (same!). कितने लड़के? (how many boys?), कितनी किताबें? (how many books?)!","pattern":"-एँ (f) · -ए (m -ा) · -ियाँ (f -ी)","examples":[{"t":"मेरे पास किताबें हैं।","r":"mere pās kitāben hain.","en":"I have books."},{"t":"कितने लड़के?","r":"kitne laṛke?","en":"How many boys?"},{"t":"तीन लड़कियाँ।","r":"tīn laṛkiyāṅ.","en":"Three girls."}],"mistakes":["Saying किताबों for subject — subjects: किताबें!","Saying कितने किताबें — feminine: कितनी!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"राहुल","t":"कितनी किताबें हैं?","r":"kitnī kitāben hain?","en":"How many books?"},{"sp":"प्रिया","t":"तीन किताबें!","r":"tīn kitāben!","en":"Three books!"},{"sp":"राहुल","t":"बहुत अच्छी!","r":"bahut achchhī!","en":"Very good! (f things)"},{"sp":"प्रिया","t":"धन्यवाद!","r":"dhanyavād!","en":"Thanks!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: Three books!","answer":"तीन किताबें"},{"type":"fill","q":"___ किताबें हैं? (How many, f)","answer":"कितनी"},{"type":"choose","q":"लड़की → plural is…","options":["लड़किए","लड़कियाँ","लड़कीयों","लड़के"],"answer":"लड़कियाँ"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: किताबें / तीन","answer":"तीन किताबें"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: तीन किताबें!","answer":"तीन किताबें!"}],"quiz":[{"q":"किताब → plural is…","options":["किताबे","किताबें","किताबों","किताबा"],"answer":1,"why":"किताब→किताबें."},{"q":"लड़का → plural is…","options":["लड़के","लड़कें","लड़कों","लड़का"],"answer":0,"why":"-ा → -े: लड़के."},{"q":"कितनी is for…","options":["masculine","feminine","plural-only","formal"],"answer":1,"why":"कितनी किताबें."},{"q":"बहुत means…","options":["few","many / very","all","some"],"answer":1,"why":"बहुत = many/very."},{"q":"लोग means…","options":["boys","people","books","girls"],"answer":1,"why":"लोग = people."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Plurals worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Hindi.","items":["books","people","many"],"key":["किताबें","लोग","बहुत"]},{"instruction":"Make plurals.","items":["किताब → …","लड़का → …","लड़की → …"],"key":["किताबें","लड़के","लड़कियाँ"]},{"instruction":"Count.","items":["How many books? (f)","Three books!"],"key":["कितनी किताबें हैं","तीन किताबें"]}]}}]},{"id":"A1-U3","title":"First verbs","lessons":[{"id":"A1-U3-L1","title":"Present: खाता हूँ / खा रहा हूँ","learn":"Two presents! खाता हूँ = I eat (habit). खा रहा हूँ = I am eating (NOW). -ता habitual, -रहा continuous! Verbs agree GENDER: boy खाता, girl खाती!","vocab":[{"t":"खाना","r":"khānā","en":"to eat","pos":"verb"},{"t":"पीना","r":"pīnā","en":"to drink","